# UNERA V2 — Check icon (Material Symbols)

Use the **Material Symbols Outlined `check` icon (FILL=0, wght 400, opsz 24)** anywhere a **circular "done" chip** needs a checkmark — not the Unicode character `✓`.

This replaces the legacy stroked `<path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>` pattern. The Material Symbols path renders identically across platforms and stays consistent with all other icons in the product. See also: `.cursor/rules/newunera-icons.mdc`.

## Canonical markup

```html
<svg class="unera-checkmark" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
     viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="16" height="16"
     fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
  <path d="M382-240 154-468l57-57 171 171 367-367 57 57-424 424Z"/>
</svg>
```

Adjust `width` / `height` to fit the chip well (16 inside a 32 chip, 18 inside a 40 chip, 20 inside a 48 chip, etc.).

## Required CSS (filled path — use `fill`, not `stroke`)

```css
.unera-checkmark {
  display: block;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  fill: currentColor;
}
```

Parent chips should set `color: white` (or equivalent) so `currentColor` matches the success surface — same pattern as `.success-icon-animated svg`.

## JS constant (static HTML demos)

```js
const UNERA_CHECKMARK_SVG = '<svg class="unera-checkmark" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M382-240 154-468l57-57 171 171 367-367 57 57-424 424Z"/></svg>';
```

Use `innerHTML = UNERA_CHECKMARK_SVG` for completed states; use `textContent = String(n)` for step numbers (clears SVG).

## Where this applies (`NewUnera/`)

| Surface | Selector / context |
|--------|---------------------|
| Desktop stepper | `#dynamicStepper .step.completed .step-circle` |
| Redeem tx tracker | `.ts-icon.ts-check` (processing + pending templates) |
| Get processing list | `.proc-icon.done` |

**Reference implementations:** `NewUnera/get-unera-cad.html`, `NewUnera/redeem-unera-cad.html`.

## Do not

- Do **not** use the old stroked path `M5 13l4 4L19 7` — replaced by Material Symbols `check`.
- Do **not** use `stroke: currentColor` or `fill: none` on `.unera-checkmark` — Material Symbols are filled paths.
- Do **not** use Unicode `✓` inside `.step-circle`, `.ts-icon.ts-check`, or `.proc-icon.done`.
- Do **not** mix `viewBox="0 0 24 24"` (legacy) with Material Symbols `viewBox="0 -960 960 960"` — they use different coordinate systems.

## Out of scope

- **Copy-only** labels (e.g. "✓ Verified", "✓ Rate updated") may stay as text.
- **Pseudo-elements** with `content: '✓'` need a different pattern if they must match this icon (real element or background SVG).
